gleam_json (MoonBit-target fork)

This project is a modified fork of gleam_json
(https://github.com/gleam-lang/json), Copyright the Gleam contributors,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENCE).

Modifications (made by the spiral-nights/gekko contributors) add MoonBit
FFI bindings (`@external(moonbit, ...)` annotations and a `moonbit/`
directory) so the package can be transpiled by gekko. All original upstream
Gleam code remains under its original copyright and licence. Files modified
from upstream carry a "Modified" note in their header.
